      "date": null,
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Antony Blinken. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/antonyblinken_china-understands-that-leadership-in-ai-is-activity-7483948490599890945-Q8XX",
