    {
      "text": "administration’s stalled war in Iran and its interventions in Venezuela and the Caribbean to the risks posed by AI. Thanks for having me, Ana. https://t.co/im0AyoUeqG",
      "date": "2026-09-21",
      "date_quote": "2026-09-21T16:59:51.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Antony Blinken. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
