      "sid": "s4",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "AI has the potential for extraordinary good, but also for catastrophic consequences if its development outpaces our ability to put the right guardrails in place.",
      "date": "2026-09-15",
      "date_quote": "2026-09-15T20:12:44.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Antony Blinken. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/ABlinken/status/2099954589487263921",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "personal",
        "speaker": "Antony Blinken",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "ABlinken",
        "user_id": "635716830"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "6d2fd89aaa467452082cbed92e5ea4daeb5e10d0f04da42173f6408dc6c21564",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "2099954589487263921",
      "account_source_url": "https://www.antonyblinken.org/about/",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "6380de50b1d4615b128cfd009b4667b9159981b9029c39d6d7b583a33c0c6ef6",
      "sid": "s5",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "China understands that leadership in AI is not just about building the most capable models. It is about shaping the rules, norms, and institutions that",
      "date": "2026-07-17",
      "date_quote": "2026-07-17T18:20:39.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Antony Blinken. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/ABlinken/status/2078183113193103407",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "personal",
        "speaker": "Antony Blinken",
