        "role": "Secretary of State"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "b093b004ef42471686e48171bb103b4aa1accc1e51445dbfa56481a51446357e",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1869870637210038670",
      "account_source_url": "https://2021-2025.state.gov/dipnote-u-s-department-of-state-official-blog/welcoming-the-71st-secretary-of-state-antony-blinken/",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "422383ff72725c3662c001e4844e01e50cf3f8a63eb322876022b0c7d8a751df",
      "sid": "s8",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "At the ASEAN-U.S. Summit in Vientiane, we discussed our robust economic engagement and intensifying cooperation in many areas, including the digital economy and AI. https://t.co/mZqEiEE2Mu",
      "date": "2024-10-11",
      "date_quote": "2024-10-11T11:18:24.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Antony Blinken. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/SecBlinken/status/1844699063142240607",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "official_role",
        "speaker": "Antony Blinken",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "SecBlinken",
        "user_id": "1350150750966603777",
        "organization_id": "state",
        "role": "Secretary of State"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "6059639a3eba10be07158f8a768dd824d1f44f0b46f0e7181d3fb2bf44eb4c3b",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1844699063142240607",
      "account_source_url": "https://2021-2025.state.gov/dipnote-u-s-department-of-state-official-blog/welcoming-the-71st-secretary-of-state-antony-blinken/",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "422383ff72725c3662c001e4844e01e50cf3f8a63eb322876022b0c7d8a751df",
      "sid": "s9",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "The U.S. is excited about AI's potential for the future. In New York, I emphasized to leaders of AI companies that we want the benefits",
      "date": "2024-09-24",
      "date_quote": "2024-09-24T02:22:54.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Antony Blinken. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/SecBlinken/status/1838403709228978198",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "official_role",
        "speaker": "Antony Blinken",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "SecBlinken",
        "user_id": "1350150750966603777",
        "organization_id": "state",
        "role": "Secretary of State"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "3b7bfb4eee920963a21bbe071d5060e6117e1d90eeb279a93506d257a6b0080f",
      "origin": "federal_x",
      "post_id": "1838403709228978198",
      "account_source_url": "https://2021-2025.state.gov/dipnote-u-s-department-of-state-official-blog/welcoming-the-71st-secretary-of-state-antony-blinken/",
      "excerpted": true,
      "attribution_span_sha256": "422383ff72725c3662c001e4844e01e50cf3f8a63eb322876022b0c7d8a751df",
      "sid": "s10",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "From AI to biotechnology, Singapore is an important partner to the U.S. when it comes to critical and emerging technologies. By joining efforts and capitalizing",
      "date": "2024-08-01",
      "date_quote": "2024-08-01T01:50:52.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Antony Blinken. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/SecBlinken/status/1818826700144390614",
      "source_type": "x",
      "verified": true,
      "verified_via": "x_api_post_text_and_author_id",
      "attribution": {
        "kind": "official_role",
        "speaker": "Antony Blinken",
        "basis": "verified_x_account",
        "account": "SecBlinken",
        "user_id": "1350150750966603777",
        "organization_id": "state",
        "role": "Secretary of State"
      },
      "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09",
      "source_text_sha256": "931e8795a2ec7eeffd1c107d98f139372a0ec2569844ab21c4e9048c29480c51",
