    {
      "text": "of the U.S.-led resolution on AI. We are working to ensure that AI systems are safe, secure, and trustworthy — and that all emerging technologies",
      "date": "2024-03-21",
      "date_quote": "2024-03-21T22:26:00.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Antony Blinken. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/SecBlinken/status/1770939945575731502",
      "source_type": "x",
