      "sid": "s16",
      "added": "2026-11-09"
    },
    {
      "text": "impact. Inspired to hear from entrepreneurs from @hiddenlayersec, @GazelleEco, and @eveVehicles on solutions to the world's biggest AI, security, data, environment, and agriculture challenges. https://t.co/rXxdoNjUqe",
